OL,3,GNEWSARacist pair jailed for Glasgow
OL,4,Acity centre 'rampage' attacks on
OL,5,Astrangers
OL,6,
OL,7,FTwo men who carried out a series of
OL,8,Fviolent attacks, including racially
OL,9,Faggravated assaults on a group of
OL,10,FChinese students in Glasgow city centre
OL,11,Fhave been jailed.
OL,13,FLiam Murphy, 19, was sentenced to nine
OL,14,Fyears in prison, while Bradley Lawrie,
OL,15,F20, was ordered to serve
OL,16,Fseven-and-a-half years.
OL,18,FMurphy pled guilty to nine mostly
OL,19,Faggravated assault charges and Lawrie
OL,20,Fto a total of seven offences which were
OL,21,Fcommitted over one night in Glasgow on
OL,22,F14 September last year.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
