OL,3,GNEWSARacist pair jailed for Glasgow
OL,4,Acity centre 'rampage' attacks on
OL,5,Astrangers
OL,6,
OL,7,FSentencing them at the High Court in
OL,8,FGlasgow, Lord Cubie described the
OL,9,Fattacks as a "rampage" and the worst
OL,10,Fcase of sustained city centre violence
OL,11,Fhe had encountered in more than 15
OL,12,Fyears.
